 StyleBox["3 minutes to evaluate",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]
}], "Subsubsection"],

Cell["\<\
1) According to Fulton, page 58, the key fact is the following:\
\>", "Text"],

Cell["\<\
